      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-make-the-ask-clear-41-dcc4456d-fb5e-4458-8425-822f4ae00b38",
        "text": "### What happens next?\n“Click here” gives few clues. \n\nA **call-to-action** should name the next step.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9ae72478984d51a1a4f7f50585de7321-exec-72fc7316-b4bd-4972-947e-3baee0863e80.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-make-the-ask-clear-41-be68f628-41fd-4b16-9687-cbdc2f0b844b",
        "text": "### Name the action.\n“Find my club” tells visitors what to do and what to expect.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9e90e3037f40a4e2a152bd6f99535875-exec-b49c01e4-6ac8-468f-baa6-f684f8c7533d.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-make-the-ask-clear-41-90457403-06f2-42a5-b0b5-744d20b9b404",
        "text": "### Put it where it helps.\nPlace the **call-to-action** where visitors are ready to act.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/ae9b640fd4cc994969d70553fed68526-exec-677f668b-e17b-4764-ab0c-a4a82fc95742.png",
        "layout": "text-top-right",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      },
      {
        "text": "### Try it on your site.\nChoose what visitors should do next. \n\nAsk AI to add a **call-to-action** that clearly names that action.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/79ea2907e35cf7577f270b5924178411-exec-83be5833-e361-4cc5-b12b-34eac81465f0.png",
        "key": "adaptive-HoAI26-make-the-ask-clear-41-5e12a9f4-ad4e-4b30-a0b9-3b4bba4fa2d5",
        "fadeInOverPrevious": true
      }
    ],
    "generate_outline": "Understand how to create clear calls-to-action. Learn why 'Click here' is vague, and how to make buttons clear with a verb and a next step, placing them where eyes naturally land.",
